msgid ""
"A text file of daily maximum and minimum temperature and precipitation, with "
"the station's name, location and base period."
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:65
msgid ""
"Missing days, outliers, jumps, repeated values and other suspect data, "
"flagged on charts and in tables so you can fix the file."
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:70
msgid ""
"Choose the parameters, then Climpact calculates the temperature, rainfall, "
"heatwave and drought indices and their trends."
